WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.696
In this video, you will build your own screen with Widgets.

00:00:03.696 --> 00:00:10.557
You pick the boxes you want to see, like your wallet, a chart, or your open trades, and you put them where you want them.

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.870
Start on the Hub, the home screen with the big tiles.

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:15.678
Click Widgets.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:18.552
This is your Widgets screen.

00:00:18.552 --> 00:00:20.174
Each box is called a widget.

00:00:20.174 --> 00:00:21.738
This one shows the scanner.

00:00:21.738 --> 00:00:23.302
This one shows your wallet.

00:00:23.302 --> 00:00:25.562
This one shows how much you made today.

00:00:25.562 --> 00:00:27.010
And there are more below.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:32.430
To choose which boxes are on your screen, click Panels, at the top right.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.269
Tick a box to add that widget to your screen.

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:37.478
Untick it to hide it.

00:00:37.478 --> 00:00:43.520
You can choose from a chart, your wallet, your open trades, your orders, coin links, and even some games.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:46.397
When you are done, click the X to close this list.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.198
To move a box, click and hold its title bar.

00:00:50.198 --> 00:00:52.746
That is the strip at the top, with its name.

00:00:52.746 --> 00:00:55.178
Drag it to where you want it, then let go.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:01:00.509
To make a box bigger or smaller, grab its bottom right corner, and pull.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:07.194
Open any coin, anywhere in the app, and the Chart box switches to that coin by itself.

00:01:07.194 --> 00:01:08.584
So does the Links box.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:14.062
The Pages button lets you pin any page of the app to the menu on the left.

00:01:14.062 --> 00:01:16.636
Then you can open it without leaving Widgets.

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:18.639
Made a mess?

00:01:18.639 --> 00:01:21.634
Click Reset layout to go back to how it started.

00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:24.505
Your screen saves by itself, on this computer.

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:26.446
That is it.

00:01:26.446 --> 00:01:28.440
Use Panels to choose your boxes.

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:32.491
Drag the title bar to move one, and pull the corner to resize it.

00:01:32.491 --> 00:01:35.482
And remember, Widgets only show you information.

00:01:35.482 --> 00:01:37.975
Nothing on this screen trades by itself.
